/*
 * Implements construction and validation of TypeInfo for classes.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - creation of the TypeInfo and TypeID values for a class,
 *   - computation of the class's runtime type identifier,
 *   - computation of the class's size(unless running in fake mode),
 *   - construction of the ancestor TypeInfo slice,
 *   - installation of the final TypeInfoValue into the ClassRefType.
 *
 * TypeInfo generation is performed after class layout and inheritance
 * validation, and before generator insertion. It provides the runtime
 * metadata required for reflection, dynamic dispatch, and low‑level
 * runtime services.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::typeinfo
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/typeinfo.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
